  "description": "Moa Son, an ordinary office worker, wakes up in a dungeon in the middle of the night and awakens as a collecting hunter. After barely making it out alive, she falls into the same dungeon but gets rescued by the first-ranked hunter, Jihan Seo, and becomes bound up with him. Now he’s offering to make her strong on this one condition --\n\n*\"Promise me you will do your best to kill the bosses of all the dungeons that exist in the world.”*\n\nCome again? \n\n(Source: WEBTOON) \n\n*Note: Includes three extra chapters.*",
